# Officious Interrogation: "any number of target players" includes none (CR 115.1d): cast with no target it costs only {W}{U}, X is 0 and no Clue is made
# (the Memnites Bot1 and Bot2 control are not counted), and the spell is cast and put into the graveyard all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Officious Interrogation
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Officious Interrogation.Cast
Bot1.Target()
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Memnite; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Officious Interrogation
